Z||000000||phillip||04-20-2000||09:49 AM||||<BR>every once in a while i'll hear about a material that you work with like fiberglass but it's more flexible. i have my rear view mirrors on the a-pillars and would like to fill in the door where the old mirrors were. or has any one done fiberglass repair on their doors? do you have to worry about the fiberglass not flexing the same as the rest of the door? thanks for any help.||||reg||1
Z||000001||TOM||04-20-2000||10:55 AM||||It is fiberglass just made using flex resin instead of rigid. I dont know if it will stick to the plastic of the door skin.||||reg||1
