Z||000003||fotofrank||04-20-2000||01:38 PM||||I used bondo fiberglass sheet fiber patch. It worked great for some strees cracks and a thumb size hole in the passenger door. Do not cut a sheet of fiberglass bigger than you can easily deal with. A 2X2 piceis all you should ues. Mix the resin and soak the fiberglass sheet in it . This make the sheet VERY hard to handle if too large.Just lay it in place ,on the preparied suffase .When dry and set a palm sander is all that is needed to blend in the edges.Painr and forget! ||||reg||1
